OL,3,ABurnham says he wants to 'repair
OL,4,Abridges' between Ukraine and US
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has he will
OL,7,Ftry to "repair bridges" between Ukraine
OL,8,Fand the United States, ahead of a
OL,9,Fmeeting with President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky at Downing Street.
OL,12,FIt comes after President Donald Trump
OL,13,Fsaid he had struck a deal with Moscow
OL,14,Fto import Russian diesel.
OL,16,FAsked about Trump's move during Prime
OL,17,FMinister's Questions, Burnham resisted
OL,18,Fcriticising the US president, saying he
OL,19,Fwanted to "be careful in terms of
OL,20,Flaying the ground to bring people back
OL,21,Ftogether".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
