OL,3,ABurnham says he wants to 'repair
OL,4,Abridges' between Ukraine and US
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, he stressed that Zelensky
OL,7,Fwould not be leaving the UK
OL,8,F"empty-handed", as he said further
OL,9,Fmilitary and financial support would be
OL,10,Fdrawn up in the coming weeks.
